# ============================================================
# SmartPort — .gitignore
# Nguyen tac: cai gi TU SINH LAI DUOC, TRUNG LAP, hoac CHUA BI MAT thi khong len git.
# ============================================================

# ---------- Rac build (.NET / Visual Studio) — tu sinh lai khi build ----------
bin/
obj/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.cache
*.pdb
TestResults/

# ---------- BI MAT — tuyet doi khong day ----------
# Mat khau tai khoan ung dung (chi luu tren may ban)
TAI-KHOAN-MOI.txt
# Ban sao luu appsettings goc co mat khau somee that
*.bak
*.local-backup
# Moi file cau hinh "local"/"secret" neu sau nay co
appsettings.*.local.json
*.secret.json
.env
.env.*

# ---------- Ban sao trung lap / luu tru ----------
# Bo dong goi di thi = ban sao y nguyen cua SmartPort.Net10 + tai lieu (508 MB)
NopThi_*/
# Ban MVC5 da ngung phat trien (216 MB) va Web.config cua no co mat khau
_Cu_KhongDung/
# Thu muc tam gom file cho Claude Design (ban sao CSS + anh)
_ThietKe_ChoClaudeDesign/

# ---------- Du lieu cong cu AI (Orion tu sinh ho so du an) — khong phai ma nguon ----------
.agent/

# ---------- Front-end React (smartport-web) — tu sinh lai bang "npm install" / "npm run build" ----------
node_modules/
# Ban build React ghi thang vao wwwroot cua API (1 ung dung khi deploy) — tu sinh lai bang "npm run build"
SmartPort.Api/wwwroot/assets/
SmartPort.Api/wwwroot/index.html
dist/
.vite/
npm-debug.log*

# ---------- Ban sao luu ma nguon truoc khi tach Front-end / Back-end (chi luu tren may) ----------
_SaoLuu/

# ---------- File tam / he dieu hanh ----------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*
*.tmp

# ---------- Model AI: CO day (app can chung de chay offline) ----------
# Khong ignore *.onnx / *.wasm / tessdata — chung la mot phan cua san pham.

# ---------- Bo sung 19/11/2026 — repo cong khai LeHuuAnhTai.SmartPort ----------
# Ma nguon chay web doi vao Web/ tu 19/09 -> cap nhat duong dan ban build React cho dung
Web/SmartPort.Api/wwwroot/assets/
Web/SmartPort.Api/wwwroot/index.html
# Du lieu sinh ra LUC CHAY (video camera, anh bien so xe, email/SMS co ma OTP + so dien thoai) — khong phai ma nguon
Web/SmartPort.Api/wwwroot/Uploads/
**/App_Data/Outbox/
**/App_Data/OutboxSms/
# Ban nen ma nguon tam (trung lap)
_claude_doc_ma_nguon.zip
# Ho so khoi nghiep (ke hoach kinh doanh, nghien cuu thi truong) va file APK da build — chi luu tren may
Khac/HoSo/KhoiNghiep/
Khac/HoSo/AppMobile/*.apk
# Cau hinh cong cu Claude Code tren may
.claude/
